# `path:line:text` (path relative to the export root).

# cheka (the secret scanner) unit tests: fabricated key shapes and AWS's
# documented example key, used to prove detection/redaction.
^internal/cheka/cheka_test\.go:[0-9]+:.*AKIA(QX3SJOD7WPXK5QWZ|IOSFODNN7EXAMPLE|ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP)
^internal/cheka/cheka_test\.go:[0-9]+:.*`-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE[ ]KEY-----`
